# Luau standards

- Use `--!strict` on all new modules
- Server is authoritative — validate all client requests on the server
- Never trust the client for loot, damage, inventory, or shared state
- Run `selene src` and `stylua --check src` before opening PRs (from `games/<name>/`)
- Edit code in Cursor under `games/<name>/src/` — not in Studio for Rojo-managed scripts
- Read `studio/CONTEXT.md` before making architectural decisions
